# ── VisioSphere AI Core — TEST ENVIRONMENT ───────────────────────────────────
# Use this file when running video-file tests with test_listener.py + evaluate.py
# Load it by running:  copy .env.test .env   (then restore .env when done)
#
# HOW TO TEST A VIDEO MANUALLY:
#   1. Uncomment ONE CAM_0_ID / CAM_0_SOURCE pair below
#   2. copy .env.test .env
#   3. python cctv_core.py
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

